.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The originals this repo was unpacked from, still sitting in the working
# directory. release.sh runs `git add -A`, which would otherwise commit a
# tarball of the repo into the repo, and a stale top-level workflow that
# users could download instead of the one in dist/. The name below is the
# old one on purpose: it is what those leftover files are called.
/alfred-passwords-quick-copy-repo.tar.gz
/Passwords Quick Copy.alfredworkflow
